  "instance_name": "commodification_of_trauma",
  "label": "Commodification of Trauma",
  "description": "The act of turning traumatic events, suffering, or the belongings of victims into commercial products or commodities for profit or amusement. The meme's implication that the shoes of victims from the Christchurch mosque shootings are 'for sale' is a grotesque example of this, reducing human suffering to a marketable item and thereby desensitizing viewers to the gravity of the tragedy.",
